e','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">摩尔线程发布并开源首个全链路自研代码大模型MusaCoder</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动拆分AI制药业务启动独立融资并整合团队，仍保持控股权</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta与信实工业达成战略合作，在印度贾姆纳格尔投建168兆瓦AI数据中心</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴千问发布国内首个全周期高考志愿填报Agent并免费开放</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/010b32fab106a9d5ac6a3b2c88d63d2a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2026年6月10日，阿里巴巴千问正式上线国内首个全周期高考志愿填报Agent，面向全国考生免费提供个性化咨询服务。该Agent基于千问高考志愿大模型，深度融合夸克8年高考数据经验，具备“志愿日历”、“志愿报告”和“志愿问答”三大核心能力。系统不仅掌握“位次法定位”等专业填报方法，还能结合历年录取数据与用户选科估分，提供精准规划建议。升级后的“志愿报告”新增就业前景、考公考编及AI趋势等前沿数据，问答功能支持跨年份分数估算并引入自我检查机制。在工程端，该Agent针对老旧机型与弱网乡村环境进行了专项优化，协同“暖芒公益”计划，旨在打破优质教育咨询资源的地域与经济壁垒。此举标志着AI Agent在垂直民生领域的深度落地，为大模型赋能社会公共服务提供了典型范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">滴滴出行全面接入微信AI生态，支持通过自然语言指令直接叫车</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d8f14b036faa84a6377d0f82e7fe2e28.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">滴滴出行今日正式宣布其核心网约车服务全面接入微信AI生态，用户无需跳转APP，在微信内通过自然语言即可完成叫车。该功能基于腾讯混元大模型与滴滴大数据及运力调度技术的深度耦合，系统可自动识别用户在微信智能体中输入的出行需求并实现一键下单。目前该功能已覆盖核心网约车业务，后续将逐步拓展至顺风车、代驾及货运等多元化场景。滴滴2026年第一季度财报显示，AI技术已成为业务增长的关键驱动力。此次合作通过将高频出行需求植入国民级社交平台，重构了服务交互模式，在优化用户出行体验的同时，有效提升了司机的接单效率，标志着出行行业正式迈入由AI深度驱动的变革新阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">摩尔线程发布并开源首个全链路自研代码大模型MusaCoder</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f2d4ee089c57499e14b49376c6e75513.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">摩尔线程正式发布并开源首个全链路自研代码大模型MusaCoder，这是业内首个完全基于国产全功能GPU底座完成全流程训练与验证的开源模型。该模型基于MTT S5000 GPU构建的“夸娥”智算集群完成Post-training，在KernelBench评测中，MusaCoder-27B-RL模型Overall Pass率达93.2%，平均分88.60%，性能超越Claude Opus 4.7、DeepSeek-V4 Pro等主流SOTA模型。MusaCoder的开源标志着国产算力生态在底层硬件到模型训练的完整范式上取得突破，开发者可利用该模型加速算子开发与模型训练。摩尔线程此前已完成对DeepSeek、Qwen等主流大模型的适配，此次发布旨在进一步释放国产全功能GPU的计算潜能，为行业提供更具自主性的AI研发工</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动拆分AI制药业务启动独立融资并整合团队，仍保持控股权</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/322294f33be68d3d0c10e184cd8905a0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动正式启动旗下AI制药业务的拆分与独立融资进程，拆分后字节跳动将继续保持对新公司的控股权。此次整合将核心团队、算法、技术平台及管线资产整体注入新主体，由刘凯负责，团队规模约50人，涵盖AI4S算法人才与资深制药专家。此前，字节内部蛋白结构预测模型团队已并入该业务线，完成了算法模型的深度整合。新公司将持续获得火山引擎的底层算力支持，继续推进基础模型研究与产业化落地。该业务团队成立于2021年，承担从基础模型研究到产业化落地的核心职能。此次独立运营标志着字节跳动AI4S业务从内部孵化迈向市场化，旨在优化资源配置并提升商业化效率，加速AI技术在生物医药领域的产业化进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta与信实工业达成战略合作，在印度贾姆纳格尔投建168兆瓦AI数据中心</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/389552366f83b75ea62f8fb7e39a333d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta近日宣布与印度信实工业达成深度战略合作，双方将在印度古吉拉特邦的贾姆纳格尔共同建设一座规模达168兆瓦的AI数据中心。该设施将作为Meta全球AI网络的重要组成部分，支持其AI模型的训练与部署。信实工业将负责该中心从设计、建设到运营的全链路服务。为实现绿色可持续计算，该中心将引入可再生能源供电及海水淡化冷却系统，Meta已同步与CleanMax及Fourth Partner Energy签署了总计近1吉瓦的可再生能源采购协议。此次合作标志着双方关系从数字服务层深入至核心算力基建领域。随着印度数据中心装机容量的快速增长，该项目将进一步夯实印度的AI算力底座，并将其更紧密地接入Meta的全球AI算力网络，以应对日益增长的AI计算负荷需求。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
